### Description

```
const model = createXai({
					apiKey: this.env.XAI_API_KEY,
				});
				const { object } = await generateObject({
					model: model.languageModel('grok-4-fast-reasoning'),
					schema: z.object({
						name: z.string(),
					}),
					system: 'Identify the name of the person from the following text',
					messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'My name is John Doe' }],
					providerOptions: {
						xai: {
							reasoningEffort: 'high',
						} satisfies XaiProviderOptions,
					},
				});
```

Throws a `[ERROR] Bad Request` error. However if i comment out the `providerOptions`, i get another error: `[ERROR] AI SDK Warning: The "responseFormat" setting is not supported by this model - JSON response format schema is not supported`

